It will do that if you're confused at the time (a rusty rustproof item
would be silly).

> 2. How do you convert an altar to your alignment, is it possible? I know
>    how to change alignments, but I'd rather convert an altar. Should you
>    kill the priest if it is in a temple?

You place a corpse onto the altar. Make sure it's not one of your own
alignment (especially unicorns!!!) and you'll be safe. If you're chaotic
you CAN safely sacrifice humans on an altar of different alignment. You
should convert the altar, then kill the priest(ess). That keeps the god
from attacking you while you put up with the priest. Priests are tough
for low level characters, so watch out.

